OL,3,GNEWSAVictorious Festival: What you need
OL,4,Ato know
OL,5,
OL,6,FVictorious Festival returns to Southsea
OL,7,FCommon this weekend.
OL,9,FFriday night will see Richard Ashcroft
OL,10,Fheadline with The Black Keys on
OL,11,FSaturday and Kasabian will close the
OL,12,Ffestival on Sunday
OL,14,FThe three-day festival on the seafront
OL,15,Fthrows open its doors on Friday -
OL,16,FSunday from 11:00 - 23:00 BST with the
OL,17,Fsite area closing on Thursday for final
OL,18,Fpreparations.
OL,20,FUp to 80,000 ticketholders are expected
OL,21,Fto go to the festival each day. There's
OL,22,Fno entry or re-entry after 20:00.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
